    "   - Cell 16-26: **CGW Analysis** (main plots: nearest distance, loudest binary, sky maps)\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Outputs**: Plots saved to `figures/` directory\n",
    "\n",
    "## Formats Supported\n",
