      "[optimistic] wrote config/cgw_cadence_weights/optimistic.json (82 pulsars, 1008 simulations, weight sum=1.000000000000)\n",
      "[realistic] wrote config/cgw_cadence_weights/realistic.json (82 pulsars, 962 simulations, weight sum=1.000000000000)\n",
